-- REFUSE_KIT (S5, Q-S5-3 (a)): resRoot and resChild are kit-only intros of
-- the kernel Resource; a guest program gets a Resource from the host. The
-- Nat comes from len (a guest word), so resRoot is the only kit item in the
-- row (a Nat literal is a kit item too: kit-literal-nat.lang).
def r : Resource := resRoot (len Size (fmUnit Size))
